@page
@model AboutUsModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<section class="about-us-panel" aria-labelledby="about-us-title">
    <h1 id="about-us-title">About Us</h1>

    <p><strong>Ascendia Enrollment Management System</strong> is a student-focused system designed to make the enrollment process easier, faster, and more organized. It provides students and school personnel with a centralized platform for managing student information, subjects, sections, enrollment status, and other enrollment-related records.</p>

    <p>The system aims to reduce manual processes and make important enrollment information easier to access and manage. Through Ascendia, students can view available subjects, enroll in subjects, check their class schedules, and monitor their enrollment status, while authorized school personnel can manage student and enrollment records efficiently.</p>

    <p>Ascendia was developed with the goal of providing a simple, organized, and user-friendly enrollment experience for both students and school administrators.</p>
</section>
